    <string name="tutorial_title_1">Time with intention</string>
    <string name="tutorial_body_1">Tioro isn’t about working 24/7 or feeling guilty for resting. Organize your day honestly: enjoy your free time knowing you’ve earned it.</string>

    <string name="tutorial_title_2">Two types of actions</string>
    <string name="tutorial_body_2">Log daily tasks or leisure as Activity, and save Activity+ for what takes real effort or priority. Balance both to pass your day.</string>

    <string name="tutorial_title_3">Real consistency, week by week</string>
    <string name="tutorial_body_3">Set your key goals in the Work Block (worth 30%% of your weekly score) and score above 50%% daily to keep your streak alive.</string>

    <string name="tutorial_title_4">Flexible, 100%% yours and completely free</string>
    <string name="tutorial_body_4">Forgot to log yesterday? Use Backup to travel back and update any day. Everything stays strictly on your device: no accounts, no cloud, and completely free.</string>
